@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About | It's All Dev Tools</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="About It's All Dev Tools: a free collection of fast, private developer utilities and electrical engineering calculators that run 100% in your browser." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.itsalldevtools.com/about" />
</HeadContent>

<article class="legal glass">
    <h1>About It's All Dev Tools</h1>
    <p>It's All Dev Tools is a free collection of @ToolCatalog.All.Count utilities across @ToolCatalog.Categories.Length categories, including formatters, encoders, generators, converters, inspectors and engineering calculators, in one fast, clean place.</p>

    <h2>Electrical engineering calculators</h2>
    <p>Alongside the developer tools, the Engineering category offers @ToolCatalog.All.Count(t => t.Category == "Engineering") calculators for electrical engineers, electricians and electronics hobbyists worldwide:</p>
    <ul>
        @foreach (var t in ToolCatalog.All.Where(t => t.Category == "Engineering"))
        {
            <li><a href="@t.Href">@t.Name</a>: @t.Summary</li>
        }
    </ul>
    <p>Cable sizing supports both IEC 60364 (mm²) and NEC 310.16 (AWG/kcmil). Power, power factor and transformer calculators handle single-phase, three-phase and DC systems at 50 or 60 Hz, and the electronics tools cover resistor color codes and LED series resistors with standard E24 values. Results are estimates; always verify against your local code and manufacturer data.</p>

    <h2>Why we built it</h2>
    <p>Many online tools send what you paste to a server. When you are pasting API responses, JWTs, SQL queries or certificates, or working through project calculations, that is a real risk.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Private:</strong> everything runs in your browser using WebAssembly; nothing is uploaded.</li>
        <li><strong>Fast:</strong> results update instantly as you type.</li>
        <li><strong>Free:</strong> no sign-up, no limits.</li>
        <li><strong>Focused:</strong> a clean interface with dark mode, favorites and a Ctrl+K command palette.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Technology</h2>
    <p>The site is built with C# and Blazor WebAssembly on .NET and hosted on Azure Static Web Apps.</p>

    <h2>Feedback and ideas</h2>
    <p>Missing a tool or found a bug? We would love to hear from you on our <a href="contact">contact page</a>.</p>

    <p><a class="btn" href="">Browse all tools →</a></p>
</article>
